 63 | Core summaries show:
 64 | - Mw 7.1 core b = 0.5012, bootstrap SD 0.0727, 95% CI 0.3940–0.6817, n≥Mc = 49, reliability = exploratory
 65 | - Mw 6.4 core b = 0.6187, bootstrap SD 0.0242, 95% CI 0.5742–0.6667, n≥Mc = 498, reliability = robust
 66 | - delta b (71core - 64core) = -0.1175
 67 | 
 68 | Evidence:
 69 | - `<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_spatial_bvalue_diagnostics/tables/core_bvalues_fmd_summary.csv`
