 94 | - post-separator Mw 7.1 core median node b = 0.6887
 95 | - post-separator Mw 6.4 core median node b = 1.0015
 96 | from `<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_spatial_bvalue_diagnostics/tables/core_radius_sensitivity_summary.csv`.
