145 | - figure: `<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_spatial_bvalue_diagnostics/figures/figure_radius_sensitivity.png`
146 | - map-level summary: `<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_spatial_bvalue_diagnostics/tables/radius_sensitivity_summary.csv`
147 | - core summary: `<PACKAGE_ROOT>/results/exp_run/outputs/01_spatial_bvalue_diagnostics/tables/core_radius_sensitivity_summary.csv`
148 | 
